WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:04,660
Tang Lang, I, the Wind Clan, have no enmity with you.

2
00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:06,260
Why did you steal my wind king ginger?

3
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:08,260
We, Lingzhu Caiyi, want to eat something sweet.

4
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:10,260
I'll give you some Feng Wang Jiang to give you face.

5
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:11,660
Don't give me a positive attitude

6
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:14,260
Caiyi, I remember you

7
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:23,470
Even the horse's third-grade sword sparrow dares to fly around in the air.

8
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:26,540
Listen up, from now on we will walk around our Lingzhu Caiyi territory.

9
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:28,540
If you dare to come again, I will break your legs.

10
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:29,540
Go away, little trash

11
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:33,270
Lingzhu Caiyi We remember

12
00:00:33,270 --> 00:00:35,270
Prepare for the sword sparrow clan’s revenge

13
00:00:36,270 --> 00:00:38,270
I'm having trouble with my elbows. It's best to have more.

14
00:00:38,270 --> 00:00:41,270
Our Lingzhu Caiyi's double swords have already become unbearable.

15
00:00:41,270 --> 00:00:44,100
Boss, the sword bird meat is quite strong.

16
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:45,100
What a pity to let go

17
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:47,100
It’s useless to eat a third-grade bird

18
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:48,100
I also want to make a king

19
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:49,100
What king

20
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:51,100
Tianluo Emperor

21
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:54,840
The leaves haven’t turned yellow yet. Why do I feel cold?

22
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:56,840
But when I think of the bear-like messenger wolf,

23
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:58,840
My heart is hot

24
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,840
Wait two more days and this place will reach its peak.

25
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:02,840
Let's see how you can escape

26
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:11,850
Lingzhu, we didn’t provoke him

27
00:01:11,850 --> 00:01:12,850
Why is this pig so crazy?

28
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:16,170
Brother Zongwei, why are you doing this?
